{"id": "decl:ODD_Eta", "name": "ODD_Eta", "node_type": "declaration", "decl_type": "def", "signature": ": Mat2", "docstring": "### Generalized Vector Field\nA section $X^M = (v^\\mu, \\xi_\\mu) \\in \\Gamma(TM \\oplus T^*M)$ combining a tangent vector\n$v$ (momentum mode generator) and a 1-form $\\xi$ (winding mode generator).\n\n- **Fo", "domain": "Double Field Theory", "cluster": "Double Field Theory", "file": "DoubleFieldTheory/GeneralizedGeometry.lean", "degree": 1}
{"id": "decl:InversionGen", "name": "InversionGen", "node_type": "declaration", "decl_type": "def", "signature": ": Mat2", "docstring": "### Bilinear Form Evaluation\nEvaluates $X^T M Y$ for a generalized matrix $M$ and generalized vectors $X, Y$.\n-/\ndef BilinearForm (M : Mat2) (X Y : GenVector) : Int :=\n  X.v * (M.a * Y.v + M.b * Y.xi)", "domain": "Double Field Theory", "cluster": "Double Field Theory", "file": "DoubleFieldTheory/GeneralizedGeometry.lean", "degree": 1}
{"id": "decl:odd_inversion_generator", "name": "odd_inversion_generator", "node_type": "declaration", "decl_type": "theorem", "signature": ": IsODD InversionGen", "docstring": "### Theorem: Inversion Generator Preservation\nThe T-duality generator is a certified element of the $O(D, D)$ duality group:\n$$\\sigma_1^T \\eta \\sigma_1 = \\eta$$", "domain": "Double Field Theory", "cluster": "Double Field Theory", "file": "DoubleFieldTheory/GeneralizedGeometry.lean", "degree": 1}
{"id": "decl:Identity2", "name": "Identity2", "node_type": "declaration", "decl_type": "def", "signature": ": Mat2", "docstring": "### Congruence Action of $O(D, D)$ Matrix\nThe transformation law of the generalized metric $\\mathcal{H}$ under duality matrix $M$:\n$$\\mathcal{H}' = M^T \\mathcal{H} M$$\n-/\ndef CongruenceAction (M H : M", "domain": "T-Duality & Buscher", "cluster": "T-Duality & Buscher", "file": "DoubleFieldTheory/TDualityBuscher.lean", "degree": 1}
